              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Samuele wakamba ne, Nulue kundi ne Agaga, mukelenge wa Bena Amaleka. Agaga wakalua kudiye ne disanka. Agaga wakamba ne. Bulelela, kanyinganyinga ka lufu kakashika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
