              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele kakalua kutangila Shaula kabidi tô ne muakafueye; kadi Samuele wakadila muadi bualu bua Shaula; ne Yehowa wakakudimuna mutshima bualu bua yeye wakasungula Shaula mukelenge wa Bena Isalele.",
